This is where your project becomes more interesting.

Do not add a watchdog yet.

A common mistake is trying to build advanced features before the foundation exists. Right now, ACTDRS can only monitor. It cannot yet detect threats, analyze them, or respond. A watchdog would simply restart a basic monitoring script.

We should build ACTDRS in layers.

ACTDRS Development Roadmap
Phase 1 : Monitoring System          ✅ (Current Phase)
Phase 2 : Threat Detection Engine
Phase 3 : AI Decision Engine
Phase 4 : Automatic Response Engine
Phase 5 : Dashboard
Phase 6 : Self-Healing (Watchdog)
Phase 7 : Cloud Notification

The Self-Healing feature only makes sense after the response engine exists.

